COLORS:

hot     Historical Strava classic thermal palette (red/orange to white/yellow high-density gradient).
orange  Monochrome orange profile introduced in newer versions of the Strava web app.
purple  Magenta / purple.
blue    Cyan / blue.
bluered Blue to red gradient.
gray    High-contrast grayscale.
